{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53485","headline":"游祝融峯 · 韩愈","name":"游祝融峯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祝融万丈拔地起，欲见不见轻烟里。\n山翁爱山不肯归，爱山醉眠山根底。\n山童寻着不敢惊，沉吟爲怕山翁嗔。\n梦回抖擞下山去，一径萝月松风清。\n（嘉靖《衡山府志》卷二。\n陶敏先生录示此诗，幷云：「此诗风格不类韩诗，疑僞，姑录以存疑。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53485.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53485","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}